// GPDK045 native Cadence adaptation; NOT a performance-matched paper reproduction.
// Missing device sizes/values use recorded defaults; see plan.json and classification CSV.
// Explicit body nets, including deliberately floating bodies, are preserved.
// PDK_BULK_N/PDK_BULK_P, where present, require an external bulk bias.
// Evidence: /projects/2022B4AA1300P/SchematicGeneration/Papers_dataset/consolidated_paper_dataset_final_locked/agnibha_mixed_pdk_20261008/cases/p04_fig4_floating_gate_cdta
// Original comments below describe the pre-conversion topology:
// original: Manually traced from batch1/images/p04_fig4_floating_gate_cdta.png, 2026-10-01.
// original: Topology-only golden netlist; not a Cadence export or simulation deck.
// original: MOS pin order: D G S. Source image does not draw independent body leads.
// original: Current-source pin order: current flows from first to second terminal.
// original: User confirmed the continuous M15-M20 gate bus and both N labels joined.
// original: PB2 therefore joins both M13/M14 drains. This is intentional image matching.
// original: The two floating-gate nodes are represented explicitly with C1-C4.
// original: Ground 0 and the lower VSS supply are different nets.
simulator lang=spectre
global 0
include "/linuxeda_new/c2scadence/FOUNDRY/analog/45nm/models/spectre/gpdk045.scs" section=tt

